WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.080
My name is Sanjok Pradhan and I am very lucky to be a part of Brindavan Boarding School

00:00:07.080 --> 00:00:14.120
family and it is my pleasure to be here and I want to learn a lot of things.

00:00:14.120 --> 00:00:19.640
I have always been curious about learning and basically this institution has provided

00:00:19.640 --> 00:00:26.360
me with a place to learn and also to teach my dear students about everything there is,

00:00:26.360 --> 00:00:29.000
not just about the bookish knowledge there is,

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:30.960
but about life itself.

00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:34.000
And also my major field is biology,

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:38.000
and I want to teach them about a beauty of science,

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:40.980
about biology, different aspects of biology.

00:00:40.980 --> 00:00:42.620
And thank you so much.

00:00:45.440 --> 00:00:49.960
So basically our school is not just an institution,

00:00:49.960 --> 00:00:53.720
it is a home for all the children out here,

00:00:53.720 --> 00:00:55.960
and we are the family.

00:00:55.960 --> 00:01:00.300
And our school is special because we love our children

00:01:00.300 --> 00:01:02.300
and basically we want to nurture them.

00:01:02.300 --> 00:01:06.520
We believe in success and not all the students,

00:01:06.520 --> 00:01:08.020
we don't treat partially.

00:01:08.020 --> 00:01:10.300
Every student is special in their own way

00:01:10.300 --> 00:01:11.540
and we respect that.

00:01:11.540 --> 00:01:14.540
And we want to nurture their special needs

00:01:16.860 --> 00:01:19.180
as well as we look after all of the children.

00:01:19.180 --> 00:01:21.980
And basically this is what makes our institution

00:01:21.980 --> 00:01:23.840
a wonderful institution.

00:01:23.840 --> 00:01:26.360
and I'm very proud to be a part of this family.

00:01:26.360 --> 00:01:27.200
Thank you.

00:01:28.380 --> 00:01:31.960
I want my students to be not just successful,

00:01:31.960 --> 00:01:33.440
but a good human being.

00:01:33.440 --> 00:01:36.240
And I think that is a very important thing

00:01:36.240 --> 00:01:37.680
that they should know.

00:01:37.680 --> 00:01:39.600
Just being educated,

00:01:39.600 --> 00:01:41.900
and just being educated does not mean

00:01:41.900 --> 00:01:43.720
that you are a good human being.

00:01:43.720 --> 00:01:45.680
I want them to learn about kindness.

00:01:45.680 --> 00:01:48.040
I want them to learn about politeness.

00:01:48.040 --> 00:01:49.800
I want them to respect their elders,

00:01:49.800 --> 00:01:52.120
and I want them to have a good life

00:01:52.120 --> 00:01:57.880
as well as a successful person with a well-mannered characteristics,

00:01:57.880 --> 00:02:02.520
as well as I hope my students always be successful

00:02:02.520 --> 00:02:04.840
and they always be kind to other human beings.

00:02:04.840 --> 00:02:05.840
Thank you.

00:02:06.680 --> 00:02:12.600
So, as our institution is a home, and every home has a head of the family,

00:02:12.600 --> 00:02:16.720
and our respected director, sir, is the head of the family,

00:02:16.720 --> 00:02:21.400
and his sacrifices have what led us to this particular place,

00:02:21.400 --> 00:02:28.840
and he has helped us to be a good teacher and he has always helped us in every part of the way

00:02:28.840 --> 00:02:35.640
to be kind and also to help us how to teach our students, how to treat them and he is also a

00:02:35.640 --> 00:02:43.480
wonderful human being as well as an example for us, an ideal example for us to be a good human

00:02:43.480 --> 00:02:45.240
being as well. Thank you so much.
